        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin PD005-PASS, 8.3\" Santa Monica Mortise Pocket Door Hardware</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Large Santa Monica Passage Set can be used for any sliding door including barn doors and pocket doors. It measures 8.3 inches tall and 2.3 inches wide and has just a .15 inch projection so it will fit in even the narrowest of spaces. It is available in a wide array of finishes. A passage set, the Baldwin PD005 comes packaged with two pulls, one for each side of the door. \r\n</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-PD005-specifications.gif?v=1704354560\" width=\"174\" height=\"264\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Baldwin PD005 Specifications\">\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Passage Function:</b> This set neither locks nor latches. It features two flush pulls and a mortise box with a built in finger edge pull to help retrieve the door from the pocket.\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/8-3-inch-santa-monica-pocket-door-privacy-set-baldwin-pd005-priv\"><b>Privacy Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/large-santa-monica-pocket-door-keyed-entry-baldwin-pd005-entr\"><b>Keyed Entry Function</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Santa Monica Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 2.3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 8.3\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: .15\"</li>\r\n<li>Cup Width: 1.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Cup Height: 6.2\"</li>\r\n<li>Cup Depth: .29\"</li>\r\n<li>Minimum Door Thickness: 1.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise faceplate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) rectangle flush pulls, a passage set mortise pull, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Large Santa Monica Pocket Door Passage Set, Baldwin PD005-PASS",
                "description": "Baldwin PD005-PASS, Large Santa Monica Pocket Door Passage Set - The Large Santa Monica Passage Set can be used for any sliding door including barn doors and pocket doors. It measures 8.3 inches tall and 2.3 inches wide and has just a .15 inch projection so it will fit in even the narrowest of spaces. It is available in a wide array of finishes. A passage set, the Baldwin PD005 comes packaged with two pulls, one for each side of the door.",
